        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Will Durant, Margaret Mitchell\n- Civilizations: Minoan civilization\n- Roles: writer, historian, philosopher, author, journalist\n\nFacts:\n- Will Durant was born on November 5, 1885, and he was an American writer, historian, and philosopher.\n- Margaret Mitchell was born on November 8, 1900, and she was an American author and journalist.\n- Historian Will Durant described the Minoans as \"the first link in the European chain.\"\n- Margaret Mitchell died on August 16, 1949.\n- Will Durant died on November 7, 1981.\n- The Minoan civilization has been described as the earliest civilization of its kind in Europe.",
